{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026A4jMZiUiZU1793198937.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國抵押貸款申請止跌回升。</p><p></p><p>美國截至10月23日的一周，抵押貸款申請按周回升百分之3.4，顯著高於前一周的下跌百分之5.3。</p><p></p><p>至於30年期固定抵押貸款利率連跌第二周，跌至7.37厘，較前一周低4點子。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:14.281154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T00:18:07.806971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:39.806496+00:00","content_hash":"9afbea5175470bc1821e4082638d9ffad215fd57c1a7baa2d4c39f3fe6592aad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:14.281154+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}